Carafe: with X87FastStack, FNSTSW reads TOP without writing the x87 stack back to memory. The status word holds
only TOP and the condition and exception bits, but FNSTSW wrote every register and the tag word in the middle of the
block, and the block's end wrote them again. MSVC code compares floats with FCOM, FNSTSW AX and TEST AH, so this
was paid at almost every float comparison. A new IR op returns TOP as the stack pass tracks it.
MIT, as the files it changes.

